{"document_id": 68, "sha256": "4d16d0c4ba158d3fe4ebaa515d97fd0d7e1e66580456e18fd1ed209f5f65f39e", "agency": "fda", "doc_type": "approval_letter", "program_id": "stelara", "engine": "prep-1.4+docling2.137.0+tables-accurate+repair1+pictables1", "watermarks_removed": 0, "routes": [{"page": 1, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=1963"}, {"page": 2, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=1466"}, {"page": 3, "route": "DIGITAL", "reason": "chars=476"}], "blocks": [{"type": "picture", "ref": "#/pictures/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [55.5, 699.4, 108.4, 756.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "caption": "", "text": "", "status": "kept", "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/0", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [108.9, 721.5, 359.9, 732.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH AND HUMAN SERVICES", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/1", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 633.3, 150.3, 646.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "BLA 125261/91", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/2", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 536.7, 293.7, 605.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Janssen Biotech, Inc. Attention: Joseph Lallier, MS, MBA Associate Director, Global Regulatory Affairs Welsh & McKean Roads, P.O. Box 776 Spring House, PA 19477", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/3", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 495.3, 154.4, 508.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Dear Mr. Lallier:", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/4", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 440.1, 526.2, 481.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Please refer to your Supplemental Biologics License Application (sBLA), dated July 27, 2012, received July 27, 2012, submitted under section 351(a) of the Public Health Service Act for Stelara ® (ustekinumab).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/5", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 398.7, 525.1, 425.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We acknowledge receipt of your amendments dated September 26, October 19, November 14, 2012, and January 8 and 22, 2013.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/6", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 357.3, 527.3, 384.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "This \"Prior Approval\" supplemental biologics application proposed labeling changes to update sections 5.4 Malignancies and 12.3 Pharmacokinetics.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/7", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 302.1, 536.2, 343.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We have completed our review of this supplemental application, as amended. It is approved, effective on the date of this letter, for use as recommended in the enclosed, agreed-upon labeling text.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": [], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/8", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 274.4, 217.3, 287.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "CONTENT OF LABELING", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/9", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 122.7, 540.1, 260.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "As soon as possible, but no later than 14 days from the date of this letter, submit, via the FDA automated drug registration and listing system (eLIST), the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.14(b)] in structured product labeling (SPL) format, as described at http://www.fda.gov/ForIndustry/DataStandards/StructuredProductLabeling/default.htm, that is identical to the enclosed labeling (text for the package insert, text for the Medication Guide) and include the labeling changes proposed in any pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements. Information on submitting SPL files using eLIST may be found in the guidance for industry titled \"SPL Standard for Content of Labeling Technical Qs and As\" at http://www.fda.gov/downloads/Drugs/GuidanceComplianceRegulatoryInformation/Guidances/U CM072392.pdf.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/10", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [72.0, 95.1, 412.1, 108.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "The SPL will be accessible via publicly available labeling repositories.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/11", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [419.4, 681.5, 552.5, 692.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Food and Drug Administration", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/12", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [419.4, 670.0, 527.5, 681.0], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Silver Spring MD 20993", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["CONTENT OF LABELING"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/13", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [388.4, 619.4, 540.0, 632.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/14", "parent": "#/body", "page": 1, "bbox": [18.0, 15.9, 121.4, 25.2], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 3250406", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/15", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 744.7, 137.3, 755.7], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_header", "text": "BLA 125261/91", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/16", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 733.1, 99.0, 744.2], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Page 2", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/17", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 654.9, 538.2, 709.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Also within 14 days, amend all pending supplemental applications that includes labeling changes for this BLA, including pending \"Changes Being Effected\" (CBE) supplements, for which FDA has not yet issued an action letter, with the content of labeling [21 CFR 601.12(f)] in MS Word format that includes the changes approved in this supplemental application.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["SUPPLEMENT APPROVAL"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/18", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 627.2, 295.9, 640.5], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/19", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 544.6, 524.1, 613.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Under the Pediatric Research Equity Act (PREA) (21 U.S.C. 355c), all applications for new active ingredients, new indications, new dosage forms, new dosing regimens, or new routes of administration are required to contain an assessment of the safety and effectiveness of the product for the claimed indication(s) in pediatric patients unless this requirement is waived, deferred, or inapplicable.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/20", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 517.0, 529.8, 530.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Because none of these criteria apply to your application, you are exempt from this requirement.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REQUIRED PEDIATRIC ASSESSMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/21", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 489.3, 246.3, 502.6], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "REPORTING REQUIREMENTS", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/22", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 448.0, 513.3, 475.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "We remind you that you must comply with reporting requirements for an approved BLA (in 21 CFR 600.80 and in 21 CFR 600.81).", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/23", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 420.4, 520.2, 433.7], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "If you have any questions, call Paul Phillips, Regulatory Project Manager, at (301) 796-3935.", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/24", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [279.0, 392.8, 327.4, 406.1], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Sincerely,", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["REPORTING REQUIREMENTS"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/25", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [279.0, 365.1, 480.6, 378.4], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "section_header", "text": "{See appended electronic signature page}", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/26", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [279.0, 282.4, 500.1, 350.9], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "Tatiana Oussova, MD, MPH Deputy Director for Safety Division of Dermatology and Dental Products Office of Drug Evaluation III Center for Drug Evaluation and Research", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/27", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [72.0, 227.2, 186.7, 254.3], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "ENCLOSURE: Content of Labeling", "status": "kept", "furniture": false, "section_path": ["{See appended electronic signature page}"], "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/28", "parent": "#/body", "page": 2, "bbox": [18.0, 15.9, 121.4, 25.2], "layer": "furniture", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "page_footer", "text": "Reference ID: 3250406", "status": "kept", "furniture": true, "speaker": "regulator", "redacted": false, "study_ids": []}, {"type": "text", "ref": "#/texts/29", "parent": "#/body", "page": 3, "bbox": [43.4, 735.9, 567.9, 749.8], "layer": "body", "route": "DIGITAL", "source": "text_layer", "label": "text", "text": "---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------", "status": "kept", "furniture": 